{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Oh no need, no need, food is not what I came here for.\" Luard said with a grateful smile. \"I am here for company during this lonely night.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:42:13.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863701706936287232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Oh, well, I don't know what you heard, but we don't rent no beds by t' hour or nothin. Strictly a family establisment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:42:52.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863701870848901140","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"Luard gives a small chuckle. \"I am sorry for my wrong wording, I simply meant I was looking for conversation.\" Luard smiles mischievously at the bartender. \"It's unfair that you know my name but not the other way around don't you think?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:44:20.788000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863702239834406932","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Oh no, a humble serving girl doesn't need a name in the noir. Just a shade of color. You can call me Violet.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:45:10.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863702449659576350","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"I didn't know that's how things worked in the noir Violet, which is a pretty name regardless.\" Luard coughs and straigthens his body up. \"So, do you have any stories about this place that could make for good conversation?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:46:40.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863702826722656286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"What? The Umbral Cup. Well no one really pays no mind to it, cept that its the only place to get a decent ale or coffee out side The City. The reason the color is so muddle is because the 2nd owner, he was an illusionist you see. And he went down right nutty trying to get color to stick right. But every one knows that color don't work right out here, and you are better off not to even try. But that didn't stop him, and we have this\" she shrugs and points to the prism like colors that dance around the room.","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:49:24.128000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863703512135368755","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Now we don't get many travelers out her, bless. this is the wrong side of Empire you know. The Noir protects her hind quaters my daddy says.\" She looks sheepish. \"Oh, sorry, bless, sometimes my mouth gets away from me. Are you sure you don't want an ale? maybe I could heat up some stew?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:51:02.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863703925226864660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"No, I'm fine. Lovely conversation beats out any drink.\" Luard smiles at her. \"Wrong side of the Empire huh? What do you mean by that?\" Luard leans forward. \"Are there any shady ongoings in this part of town?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:52:50.169000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863704376333434881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Oh you are a right funny one. Shade he says. The Noir's not got anything but shade. Monochromatic they calls it. This is the back end of the city. If it werent for that terrible place, the Red Coats could march right in and take all of empire by land. The ravens. That'd be Huginn and Muninn. They keep the noir being the noir and thats good for them and good for us. We don't have them Red Coats crawling around like in hampstead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:56:09.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863705213566320661","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Its a vast impassible place full of funny things, where they say things. Like right proper things. Objects, can become people. Thats the shadowborn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:57:20.493000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T08:57:27.187000Z","id":"863705510154076170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Hmmm..\" Luard goes silent for a while, taking in all the information. \"I've heard stories of Huginn and Munnin, the ravens of the All Father they say. I'm thankful for them as well then, it's thanks to them that the guards didn't pursue me further. It would be nice if I could give my thanks personally....\" A curious look paints Luard's face. \"Say, Violet, have you ever met them, before?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:59:59.256000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T09:00:49.261000Z","id":"863706176053968907","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
