{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Well thats what I've been trying to say, bless your heart. No one knows what they've said. Thats entire point. You go to give them the memories you don't want any more. Or the thoughts that haunt you. We all know they take them from us when we don't want them any more.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:07:28.520000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T09:07:45.320000Z","id":"863708060403892234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Thats who they are Huginn and Muninn. Thought and Memory.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:08:06.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863708219448885248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Ahhh.\" Sudden realization hits Luard. \"I see.. I see..\" Luard takes a moment to contemplate. \"So do you actively find for them or do they just appear when you need them?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:09:34.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863708587225513994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"We all know where to go to see them, but they go where and when they want. It's not like you could stop *those* ravens.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:10:21.104000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T09:10:25.525000Z","id":"863708784275095552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
