{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Just out past the lamps that ring Kingsbridge. Just a short walk in the noir to the <#861037314298085387> \"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:11:52.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863709167088566273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"I'll keep that to mind.\" Luard reclines back on his seat. \"That was a rather interesting tale, nearly enough to sate my appetite for conversation.\" Luard allows a couple seconds of silence to cover the room. \"How about a more specific and recent tale in this borough? Give me some juicy rumors Violet.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:14:01.669000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863709709391495178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Oh right. My nan says they've got a new post man. Won't shut up about his bum.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T09:14:49.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863709909032108082","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
